# Databricks notebook source
# ============================================================
# UNITY CATALOG LINEAGE BACKBONE + ROOT-SPECIFIC PATH BUILDER
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Inputs:
#   - root_table widget: schema.table (for example: npdataset.npd_current_pending)
#   - table/column source MVs in eciscor_prod.information_schema
#
# Outputs:
#   1) Append-only raw history tables
#   2) Version/change-log tables
#   3) Current direct edge tables
#   4) Root-specific table lineage paths
#   5) Root-specific column lineage paths
#
# Design choices:
#   - No SQL recursive CTEs, so there is no notebook-level hop cap.
#   - Current state = latest target write event.
#   - History = append-only raw rows + version tables.
#   - Root values persist on every output row.
# ============================================================

